     2766   end.
     2767   run gen-key-rec IN THIS-PROCEDURE ( input 'clients':U
     2768                                     , input (buffer buf_clients:handle)
     2769                                     , output v-uniq-key-rec).
     2770   find first buf_ext-classif no-lock
     2771         where buf_ext-classif.uniq-key-rec = v-uniq-key-rec
     2772           and buf_ext-classif.classif-subject = 'clients':U
     2773           and buf_ext-classif.classif-name    = 'clients-edoc-nn':U no-error.
     2774   if available buf_ext-classif then do :
